stateDiagram-v2
  accTitle: Proposal offer lifecycle
  accDescr: A draft passes required approval and delivery readiness. Sending is distinct from sent viewed accepted rejected or expired. Delivery unknown requires review. Onboarding has a separate configured outcome.
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> Reviewed: Required fields, prices and approval
  Reviewed --> Sending: Delivery checks pass
  Sending --> Sent: Confirmed provider outcome
  Sending --> DeliveryUnknown: Outcome uncertain
  DeliveryUnknown --> ReviewAttempt: Inspect before retry
  Sent --> Viewed: Recorded view
  Sent --> Accepted: Valid customer response
  Viewed --> Accepted: Valid customer response
  Viewed --> Rejected: Valid customer response
  Sent --> Rejected: Valid customer response
  Sent --> Expired: Validity elapsed
  Viewed --> Expired: Validity elapsed
  Sent --> Superseded: Replacement offer
  Accepted --> OnboardingOutcome: If configured
